---
// components
import Heading from "../../elements/Heading.astro";
import Container from "../../elements/Container.astro";
import Text from "../../elements/Text.astro";
---

<Container variant={'xl'} class="text-center text-base-900 flex flex-col items-center"> <Heading tagName="h1" tagSize="h1">Contact</Heading> <div class="max-w-3xl flex flex-col gap-4">
<Text variant={'xl'}>Let's Turn Data Into Something Meaningful!</Text>
<Text variant={'sm'}>Have a data problem, project idea, or opportunity in mind? I'd love to connect and explore how data analytics, machine learning, visualization, or data engineering can help turn ideas into practical solutions.</Text>
<Text variant={'sm'}>Currently open to internship opportunities, collaborative projects, and data-driven challenges.</Text> 
</div> 
</Container>
